{"id":"vod_md_3213","vodId":"3213","provider":"md","providerName":"魔都动漫","type":2,"name":"终结的炽天使","name_cn":"终结的炽天使","date":"2015-01-01","year":"2015","region":"jp","area":"日本","platform":"日韩动漫","remarks":"12集全","images":{"common":"https://www.mdzypic.com/upload/vod/20230824-1/658de3fa573746fc17926be71ab08208.jpg"},"summary":"故事发生在遥远的未来，一种神秘的病毒侵袭了地球，十三岁以上的人类全部灭绝，可是，对于那些幸存下来的孩子们来说，活着却并不意味着幸运，横空出世的吸血鬼一族成为了地球上的统治者，而这些孩子们则作为它们的口粮被“饲养”起来。优一郎（入野自由 配音）和米伽尔（小野贤章 配音）不愿意向命运低头，为了反抗，优一郎加入了日本帝鬼军，成为了月鬼组的一员。在那里，优一郎结识了特立独行的柊筱娅（早见沙织 配音）、善良软弱的早乙女与一（冈本信彦 配音）、温文尔雅的君月士方（石川界人 配音）和大大咧咧的三宫三叶（井口裕香 配音），五人成为了生死与共的战友。","rating":{"score":0},"tags":[{"name":"动作,动画,奇幻"}],"sourceType":"third-party","updatedAt":"2023-08-24 09:02:49","playable":true,"episodeCount":12,"classic":true,"classicRank":120,"franchise":"终结的炽天使","playGroups":[{"name":"modum3u8","episodes":[{"name":"第1集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230822/Z8kNrD6v/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第2集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230822/Y4RoGQ7a/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第3集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230822/lF9QOelS/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第4集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230822/9C02l3Na/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第5集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230822/EdTGx74f/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第6集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230822/262OPFeX/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第7集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230822/FKLDf86c/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第8集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230822/26mruJ3W/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第9集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230822/sBjFzQUq/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第10集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230822/aErGofGF/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第11集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230822/bkIWl9hE/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第12集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230822/BcTxO3ZL/index.m3u8"}]}],"snapshotAt":"2026-10-22T05:52:11.409Z"}